name: "phighthouse-accelerators"
displayName: "PHIGHTHOUSE! ACCELERATORS"
description: '''
PHIGHTHOUSE! is a style i made up which is basically  a combonation of phighting, a 5v5 fighting game by boggio, and whitehouse, a british extreme music band started by w. bennett.

this mod adds accelerators for the mod's cores, very unbalanced indeed.

[#D75a58[]]requires the phighthouse mod to work.
'''
subtitle: '''
it's time to accelerate!
'''
